    "slug": "ndr-management-indian-d2c-rescuing-38-percent-failed-cod-whatsapp-triage",
    "title": "NDR (Non-Delivery Report) Management for Indian D2C Brands: Rescuing 38% of Failed COD Deliveries via Same-Day WhatsApp Triage",
    "category": "Operations",
    "date": "November 27, 2026",
