    "slug": "gstr1-b2b-vs-b2cs-filing-checklist-indian-d2c-retail-sellers",
    "title": "GSTR-1 B2B vs B2CS Filing Checklist for Indian D2C & Retail Sellers: Avoiding ₹25,000 Late Fees & Mismatch Notices",
