    "slug": "90-day-d2c-cashflow-cod-remittance-lag-india-18-lakh-month",
    "title": "90-Day D2C Cashflow & COD Remittance Lag in India: How ₹18 Lakh/Month Brands Run Out of Bank Balance While Showing Profit",
    "date": "November 25, 2026",
