    "slug": "local-first-browser-tools-vs-cloud-billing-saas-india",
    "title": "Local-First Browser Tools vs Cloud Billing SaaS in India: Protecting Client GSTINs, Margin Data & ₹18,000/Year in Cash",
    "date": "November 22, 2026",
    "category": "Operations",
    "readTime": "9 min read",
