    "title": "Mobile-First Google SERP Snippets in India: Why 78% of Searchers See 360px Wrapped Titles on Android Phones",
    "date": "November 22, 2026",
    "category": "Growth & SEO",
    "readTime": "8 min read",
    "wordCount": 1682,
