    "slug": "qr-code-quiet-zones-print-contrast-packaging-scan-rates-india",
    "title": "QR Code Quiet Zones, Print Contrast & Packaging Scan Rates in India: Why 25% of Box Inserts Fail Smartphone Cameras",
    "date": "November 22, 2026",
    "category": "Growth & SEO",
    "readTime": "9 min read",
    "wordCount": 1709,
    "image": "images/tapping-preview.jpg",
