    "slug": "abandoned-cart-recovery-whatsapp-india-55000-monthly-revenue",
    "title": "Abandoned Cart Recovery on WhatsApp in India: Turning Unpaid Checkout Drop-Offs into ₹55,000+ Monthly Revenue",
    "date": "November 20, 2026",
