    "slug": "instagram-bio-link-in-bio-page-speed-math-whatsapp-conversions",
    "title": "Instagram Bio & Link-in-Bio Page Speed Math: Why Replacing Bloated Linktrees with a Fast Page Lifts Tap-to-WhatsApp Conversions by 28%",
    "date": "November 18, 2026",
