    "slug": "hsn-code-gst-slab-mistakes-freeze-itc-indian-sellers",
    "title": "HSN Code & GST Slab Mistakes That Freeze Input Tax Credit (ITC) for Indian Sellers",
    "date": "November 15, 2026",
    "category": "Operations",
